abels","id":173769,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTczNzY5","number":6,"title":"GLM 0.9.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":91,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:31Z","updated_at":"2019-04-02T09:34:45Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2016-11-07T21:41:52Z","updated_at":"2016-11-09T22:10:05Z","closed_at":"2016-11-09T20:47:16Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm running a 32 bit system that has a processor with AVX support, and it seems that this section\r\n\r\n```\r\n#       if GLM_ARCH & GLM_ARCH_AVX_BIT\r\n        template <>\r\n        GLM_FUNC_QUALIFIER int bitCount(uint32 x)\r\n        {\r\n                return _mm_popcnt_u32(x);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        template <>\r\n        GLM_FUNC_QUALIFIER int bitCount(uint64 x)\r\n        {\r\n                return static_cast<int>(_mm_popcnt_u64(x));\r\n        }\r\n#       endif\r\n```\r\n\r\nfrom /usr/include/glm/detail/func_integer_simd.inl is giving me headaches, namely in the form of:\r\n\r\n/usr/include/glm/detail/func_integer_simd.inl: In function ‘int glm::bitCount(genType) [with genType = long long unsigned int]’:\r\n/usr/include/glm/detail/func_integer_simd.inl:60:43: error: ‘_mm_popcnt_u64’ was not declared in this scope\r\n   return static_cast<int>(_mm_popcnt_u64(x));\r\n\r\nMy compiler is gcc 5.4.0, and when I manually try something like\r\n\r\n```\r\n#include <smmintrin.h>\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n\r\nint main(void) {\r\n        int res = _mm_popcnt_u64(0);\r\n        printf(\"Result res should be 0: %d\\n\", res);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nit also fails with\r\n\r\ntest.c: In function ‘main’:\r\ntest.c:5:12: warning: implicit declaration of function ‘_mm_popcnt_u64’ [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]\r\n  int res = _mm_popcnt_u64(0);\r\n            ^\r\n/tmp/ccaMYiyR.o: In function `main':\r\ntest.c:(.text+0x17): undefined reference to `_mm_popcnt_u64'\r\ncollect2: error: ld returned 1 exit status\r\n\r\nwhile\r\n\r\n```\r\n#include <smmintrin.h>\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n\r\nint main(void) {\r\n        int res = _mm_popcnt_u32(0);\r\n        printf(\"Result res should be 0: %d\\n\", res);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nbuilds successfully.\r\n\r\nI'm sorry that I don't have much more of a clue but only these observation, but if _mm_popcnt_u64 is indeed not supposed to be there on 32 bit, then /usr/include/glm/detail/func_integer_simd.inl would probably have to be changed in a way so that it doesn't get used when a 32 bit processor that supports AVX is present. Indeed, commenting out the code quoted above fix my original build errors.","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/567/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}